========================== About this file ==========================
This file is used to mark this image as "Ventoy Compatible".

========================== About Ventoy =============================
https://www.ventoy.net

Ventoy is an open source tool to create bootable USB from ISO files. 
With ventoy, you just copy the iso file to the USB drive and boot it. 
You can copy many iso files at a time and ventoy will give you a boot menu to select them.
Both Legacy BIOS and UEFI are supported in the same way. 
Most type of OS are supported, Windows/Linux/Unix/VMware/XenServer ... 

